The '''Sundari Royal Palace''' was the residence of the [[Mandalorian]] ruler on [[Sundari]], [[Mandalore]]. Before the [[Clone Wars]], it was the home of [[New Mandalorians|New Mandalorian]] leader [[Duchess]] [[Satine Kryze]].<ref name="TMP" /> The [[Mandalorian Government Council]] would meet in her throne room, the [[Grand Salon]].<ref name="Corruption">{{TCW|Corruption (episode)}}</ref> The palace overlooked a [[Sundari Royal Palace plaza|public plaza]] where the government could address Sundari's Mandalorians from a balcony.<ref name="Shades of Reason">{{TCW|Shades of Reason}}</ref>

